** \:304c\:73fe\:5b9f\:7684\:3067\:3059\:3002\n\n### \:8a2d\:8a08\:6848: \
`ClaudeGraph`\n\n```mathematica\n(* \
\:8a2d\:8a08\:30b3\:30f3\:30bb\:30d7\:30c8\:306e\:30b9\:30b1\:30c3\:30c1 *)\n\
(* ClaudeGraph: LLMGraph \:30a4\:30f3\:30b9\:30d4\:30ec\:30fc\:30b7\:30e7\
\:30f3\:306e\:30ab\:30b9\:30bf\:30e0\:30b0\:30e9\:30d5 *)\nclauseGraph = \
ClaudeGraph[<|\n  \"readSource\" -> <|\n    \"EvaluationFunction\" -> \
(ReadString[#packageFile] &),\n    \"AccessLevel\" -> \"Local\"\n  |>,\n  \
\"generateUpdate\" -> <|\n    \"LLMProvider\" -> \"ClaudeCode\",  (* or \
\"LMStudio\" *)\n    \"Prompt\" -> \"Update this code: \
`readSource`\\nInstruction: `instruction`\",\n    \"AccessLevel\" -> \"API\",\
\n    \"Fallback\" -> {\"LMStudio\", \"ClaudeCode\"}\n  |>,\n  \
\"validateMerge\" -> <|\n    \"EvaluationFunction\" -> \
(iSafeMerge[#readSource, #generateUpdate] &),\n    \"TestFunction\" -> \
(StringQ[#] && StringLength[#] > 100 &),\n    \"AccessLevel\" -> \"Local\"\n  \
|>,\n  \"writeResult\" -> <|\n    \"EvaluationFunction\" -> (Export[#dest, \
#validateMerge, \"Text\"] &),\n    \"AccessLevel\" -> \"FileSystem\"\n  |>\n\
|>]\n```\n\n### \:30a2\:30af\:30bb\:30b9\:30ec\:30d9\:30eb\:4f53\:7cfb\n\n- `\
